1
00:00:00,862 --> 00:00:03,032
(Stuart:)Oh, no. I don't want
to be an inconvenience.

2
00:00:03,031 --> 00:00:05,961
(Stuart:)You've got all your
lady friends, and...

3
00:00:05,967 --> 00:00:07,937
(Raj:)Actually, I'm single now.

4
00:00:07,936 --> 00:00:09,106
What?!

5
00:00:09,104 --> 00:00:10,374
(Stuart:)When did that happen?

6
00:00:10,372 --> 00:00:12,272
(Raj:)It's okay. It's by choice.

7
00:00:12,274 --> 00:00:15,544
(Raj:)Well, their choice,
and it's not okay.

8
00:00:15,544 --> 00:00:18,144
(Stuart:)Oh. Sorry.
I didn't know.

9
00:00:18,146 --> 00:00:21,886
(Raj:)Nobody does. I was embarrassed
so I didn't say anything.

10
00:00:21,883 --> 00:00:23,783
(Bernadette:)Why wouldn't he tell us?

11
00:00:23,785 --> 00:00:25,785
(Bernadette:)Are we bad friends?

12
00:00:25,787 --> 00:00:28,187
(Howard:)He's in our hot tub
drinking our wine.

13
00:00:28,189 --> 00:00:30,859
(Bernadette:)Yeah, he deserves
to be alone.

14
00:00:32,227 --> 00:00:35,097
(Stuart:)So you're back out
on the dating scene now?

15
00:00:35,096 --> 00:00:37,066
(Raj:)Yeah, yeah, a little.

16
00:00:37,065 --> 00:00:38,935
(Stuart:)Oh, that must be fun.
How's that going?

17
00:00:38,934 --> 00:00:41,604
(Raj:)I'm in a hot tub with you,
so pretty bad.

18
00:00:44,606 --> 00:00:47,306
(Amy:)Maybe I should just give in
to his stupid bathroom schedule.

19
00:00:47,309 --> 00:00:48,939
(Leonard:)No, don't do that.

20
00:00:48,944 --> 00:00:50,914
- But you did!
- Exactly!

21
00:00:50,912 --> 00:00:53,542
Learn from my mistakes!

22
00:00:53,548 --> 00:00:56,518
No matter where
I am at 7:18 a.m.,

23
00:00:56,518 --> 00:01:01,018
there better be
a toilet nearby.

